{
"file": 38,
"paths": [
"d002/f655"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "058bcc43",
"en_raw": "A couple whose parents opposed their marriage"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "1d82ec2b",
"en_raw": "jumps off Takadai Street"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "da9de04a",
"en_raw": "The last thing remembered"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "df315035",
"en_raw": "is the juice they shared"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "fa651913",
"en_raw": "just before the suicide"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "c6f55eef",
"en_raw": "So that vending machine"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "53f2185e",
"en_raw": "is cursed, you see"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "15bc11b1",
"en_raw": "...How's that?"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "b35034f0",
"en_raw": "How's what, what do you mean?"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "9ce52f16",
"en_raw": "I mean, did it get"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "92ae8356",
"en_raw": "a little scary?"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "eb301a2c",
"en_raw": "It's not really a scary story"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "044e614e",
"en_raw": "And honestly, that"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "c7e8a1c3",
"en_raw": "doesn't matter"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "4b5512e6",
"en_raw": "Where did you get"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "a44623b0",
"en_raw": "that dumb-sounding rumor?"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "825e42f8",
"en_raw": "Where from?"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "3cbdde96",
"en_raw": "I mean, which Yuasa"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "c922db8d",
"en_raw": "did you hear it from"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "ca423fcc",
"en_raw": "It wasn't Yuasa"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "fef02d6d",
"en_raw": "I heard it from... Nishi"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "fac75b34",
"en_raw": "Takayuki Nishi?!"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "32edbd50",
"en_raw": "Wait a sec, hey"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "43d32142",
"en_raw": "Takayuki Nishi, as in"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "de27cd3e",
"en_raw": "the one I know"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "bf99acd3",
"en_raw": "top grades, great at sports"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "bb9fe157",
"en_raw": "super popular..."
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "8385884e",
"en_raw": "That Takayuki Nishi, right?"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "524fc0f0",
"en_raw": "Yes"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "02598ab8",
"en_raw": "Hmm... all right"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "8a87a90c",
"en_raw": "Today it's the vending machine on Takadai Street"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "6a49cab6",
"en_raw": "What, all of a sudden?"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "0562420c",
"en_raw": "The source of a rumor"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "7e6314f7",
"en_raw": "is that important"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "78d3077b",
"en_raw": "...Get it?"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "ff6a7977",
"en_raw": "When it's Takayuki Nishi's story"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "a90f5e75",
"en_raw": "credibility goes up 200%!"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "45dacd17",
"en_raw": "And if, hypothetically"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "a82349f3",
"en_raw": "nothing happens"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "36ac0d14",
"en_raw": "I feel like I'll find"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "490b413b",
"en_raw": "that guy's weak point"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "8ad8194f",
"en_raw": "It's not such a big deal"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "650b4163",
"en_raw": "Anyway, let's go to Takadai Street"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "415a3f3d",
"en_raw": "Hey, Kurumi Shiina"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "6faa7a3c",
"en_raw": "Yeees?"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "a3cb0aae",
"en_raw": "About that juice!"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "9f17d334",
"en_raw": "Why did you drink it all"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "8af18b23",
"en_raw": "by yourself?"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "5c867a11",
"en_raw": "Because it was tasty"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "dc3850cd",
"en_raw": "'Tasty' alone"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "94095342",
"en_raw": "doesn't tell us what's mysterious"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "f6f8f953",
"en_raw": "about the juice at all"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "98ea67e9",
"en_raw": "But it was tasty"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "1e13c353",
"en_raw": "So how, exactly?"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "2d8ced48",
"en_raw": "Like the world turning rainbow"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "2c7e5cfd",
"en_raw": "time feeling strangely slow"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "4c33e71f",
"en_raw": "getting abnormally hooked..."
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "947a53ba",
"en_raw": "Um, well"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "3d310b66",
"en_raw": "it was a squirmy kind of tasty"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "b3e204d6",
"en_raw": "Tch, I should've been the one to drink it"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "2f17cd07",
"en_raw": "Then let's go"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "cd250576",
"en_raw": "to the vending machine again"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "c78d4a77",
"en_raw": "This time for sure"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "9b30765e",
"en_raw": "I'll try drinking it"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "2df85d2c",
"en_raw": "Secret trick! Secret trick!"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "04db4f55",
"en_raw": "Hey, Sango"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "44c226fd",
"en_raw": "Let's go buy"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "ba9bd2cc",
"en_raw": "that juice again today!"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "4ffe666f",
"en_raw": "...Shiina, you"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "27d4489c",
"en_raw": "can chug down something"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "1e714f11",
"en_raw": "someone else drank from"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "2e9579b7",
"en_raw": "It was tasty"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "8809f3b1",
"en_raw": "Nao's juice"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "d64a98e8",
"en_raw": "I don't mind either"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "202e079a",
"en_raw": "It didn't taste special to me"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "54948d02",
"en_raw": "That's not what I'm"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "9e9cc5cd",
"en_raw": "talking about"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "d3986b11",
"en_raw": "Shiina is, how to put it"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "9071d549",
"en_raw": "too defenseless"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "2bf0bfbe",
"en_raw": "Why is drinking my juice"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "b866aa8b",
"en_raw": "defenseless?"
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "831fc79f",
"en_raw": "Even if there were poison"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "5bbd1494",
"en_raw": "it's safe, right?"
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "9240d213",
"en_raw": "Because I drank first"
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "9825a71f",
"en_raw": "That's why!"
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "3764dd8c",
"en_raw": "......"
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "d6fc2c89",
"en_raw": "Then we can't verify"
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "07beab25",
"en_raw": "what's mysterious about it at all"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "a580a4fb",
"en_raw": "Then we should just"
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "3ab1422d",
"en_raw": "go buy it again"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "c78d4a77",
"en_raw": "This time for sure"
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "9b30765e",
"en_raw": "I'll try drinking it"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "2df85d2c",
"en_raw": "Secret trick! Secret trick!"
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "8178a5b7",
"en_raw": "I looked up the vulture-logo"
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "42ac6012",
"en_raw": "Yamakagashi Pharmaceutical"
},
{
"n": 95,
"h": "91f0f849",
"en_raw": "and that company"
},
{
"n": 96,
"h": "52c049a5",
"en_raw": "went bankrupt 18 years ago"
},
{
"n": 97,
"h": "0e37fc48",
"en_raw": "...So that was"
},
{
"n": 98,
"h": "bc481ce2",
"en_raw": "18-year-old juice?"
},
{
"n": 99,
"h": "bbc8a6d0",
"en_raw": "Eighteen-year-old juice?"
},
{
"n": 100,
"h": "0ff24ec9",
"en_raw": "Right..."
},
{
"n": 101,
"h": "0467ce92",
"en_raw": "The unidentifiable liquid"
},
{
"n": 102,
"h": "97c3e10f",
"en_raw": "left behind by that bankrupt company"
},
{
"n": 103,
"h": "5d354a40",
"en_raw": "matured in the can"
},
{
"n": 104,
"h": "b8dcba66",
"en_raw": "and became a mysterious life form..."
},
{
"n": 105,
"h": "1bfc0e21",
"en_raw": "...Blech"
},
{
"n": 106,
"h": "81b822e5",
"en_raw": "...Ugh"
},
{
"n": 107,
"h": "c11245a8",
"en_raw": "Vending machines are so familiar"
},
{
"n": 108,
"h": "795fd092",
"en_raw": "but honestly"
},
{
"n": 109,
"h": "3b39fd9d",
"en_raw": "they're black boxes"
},
{
"n": 110,
"h": "8f0ef26e",
"en_raw": "Yeah..."
},
{
"n": 111,
"h": "d3e6368a",
"en_raw": "But more than that, why"
},
{
"n": 112,
"h": "b81a7b26",
"en_raw": "did Nishi know"
},
{
"n": 113,
"h": "b1e3690c",
"en_raw": "this rumor?"
},
{
"n": 114,
"h": "97143844",
"en_raw": "Somehow, I think Nishi is..."
},
{
"n": 115,
"h": "6d74bf43",
"en_raw": "...the real black box"
},
{
"n": 116,
"h": "c8b53666",
"en_raw": "Solved the rumor of the Secret Trick"
},
{
"n": 117,
"h": "c8152b06",
"en_raw": "After that"
},
{
"n": 118,
"h": "835b2564",
"en_raw": "I asked Nishi again"
},
{
"n": 119,
"h": "bacae084",
"en_raw": "about the vending machine"
},
{
"n": 120,
"h": "99d74503",
"en_raw": "secret trick"
},
{
"n": 121,
"h": "47d84bc2",
"en_raw": "But what do you think"
},
{
"n": 122,
"h": "74e2c385",
"en_raw": "Nishi said?"
},
{
"n": 123,
"h": "9d8eecac",
"en_raw": "...I don't remember saying that"
},
{
"n": 124,
"h": "2f8311cd",
"en_raw": "he said!"
},
{
"n": 125,
"h": "14f5784c",
"en_raw": "Enough, drop it"
},
{
"n": 126,
"h": "da16b673",
"en_raw": "Let's talk about something else already!"
}
]
}